# Source design files (Photoshop). Huge, and nothing in the build reads them —
# web-ready assets are exported to public/brand/ instead.
# design/logo-refs/ is the exception: tiny SVGs the platform icons were traced
# from, worth keeping so the icons can be re-derived.
/design/*
!/design/logo-refs/
*.psd
*.psb
